    "description": "Protected Provider service management under /providers/:providerId/services and Staff approval under /staff/providers. No anonymous Browse or Booking routes. Operations: listProviderServices, createProviderService, getProviderService, replaceProviderServiceConfiguration, proposeProviderServicePrice, changeProviderServiceLifecycle, listProviderServicePriceHistory, listProviderServiceStatusHistory, listStaffPendingServicePriceProposals, getStaffPendingServicePriceProposal, decideStaffServicePriceProposal.",
